  <div class="section-title">PROJECT TITLE</div>
  <div class="project-title" contenteditable="true">
    Cloud-Based POS Software Installation & Implementation for Rajon International
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">1. PROJECT SCOPE</div>
  <p>TechSeba will provide, install, configure and implement a cloud-based POS software for Rajon International. The standard package includes:</p>

  <ul class="scope">
    <li contenteditable="true">Business profile setup and configuration</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">User management and role permission</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Product and category management</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Supplier management</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Customer management</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Purchase management</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Sales and billing</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Invoice / challan printing</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Purchase return and sales return</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Stock and inventory management</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Barcode support, where required</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Daily transaction summary</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Purchase report</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Sales report</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Profit report</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Stock report and low-stock alert</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Dedicated subdomain setup and deployment</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Basic training and remote support</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-title">2. INVESTMENT & PAYMENT TERMS</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Description</th><th style="width:28%">Amount (BDT)</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td contenteditable="true">Installation Fee (One Time)</td>
        <td class="amount" contenteditable="true">৳30,000</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td contenteditable="true">Yearly Hosting, Maintenance & Support Renewal</td>
        <td class="amount" contenteditable="true">৳18,000 / Year</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Total Installation Fee</strong></td>
        <td class="amount" contenteditable="true">৳30,000</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="note" contenteditable="true">
    The yearly renewal fee will become payable after completion of the first service year. Any custom module, special report, third-party integration or major modification will be quoted separately.
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <span>TechSeba • One Click Solution • techseba.com</span>
    <span class="page-no">Page 1 of 2</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page">
  <div class="top-line"></div>
  <div class="header">
    <img src="data:image/png;base64," class="logo" alt="TechSeba Logo">
    <div class="doc-title">
      <h1>WORK ORDER</h1>
      <div class="meta">
        Client: <span class="editable" contenteditable="true">Rajon International</span><br>
        Date: <span class="editable" contenteditable="true">27 July 2026</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">3. PAYMENT SCHEDULE</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th style="width:8%">SL.</th><th>Payment Stage</th><th style="width:25%">Amount (BDT)</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>01</td><td contenteditable="true">Advance Payment upon signing the Work Order</td><td class="amount" contenteditable="true">৳15,000</td></tr>
      <tr><td>02</td><td contenteditable="true">After Installation, Configuration and Training</td><td class="amount" contenteditable="true">৳10,000</td></tr>
      <tr><td>03</td><td contenteditable="true">After Final Delivery and Acceptance</td><td class="amount" contenteditable="true">৳5,000</td></tr>
      <tr><td colspan="2"><strong>Total Installation Fee</strong></td><td class="amount" contenteditable="true">৳30,000</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">4. DELIVERY TIME</div>
  <p contenteditable="true">
    The project will be completed within 5–7 working days after receiving the advance payment and all required business information, branding materials, product data and approval from the client.
  </p>

  <div class="section-title">5. CLIENT RESPONSIBILITIES</div>
  <ul class="terms">
    <li contenteditable="true">Provide correct business, product, supplier, customer and opening-stock information.</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Provide suitable computer, printer, scanner, internet connection and other required hardware.</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Keep usernames, passwords and authorised access secure.</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Nominate one authorised representative for communication and approval.</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Make all payments according to the agreed schedule.</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Verify reports and opening balances before final acceptance.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-title">6. SUPPORT & MAINTENANCE</div>
  <p contenteditable="true">
    TechSeba will provide standard remote technical support, maintenance, confirmed bug fixes, hosting monitoring and backup during the active support period. Support does not include hardware repair, internet problems, third-party software issues, data-entry services or new custom development.
  </p>

  <div class="section-title">7. LEGAL ADVISOR</div>
  <div class="legal">
    <div>
      <strong>KAZI SHAJIR UDDIN</strong><br>
      LL.B (Hon's), LL.M<br>
      Advocate, Supreme Court of Bangladesh
    </div>
    <div>
      Contact: 01723-416969, 01816-399435<br>
      Email: kshajiruddin@gmail.com<br>
      Facebook: facebook.com/kshajiruddin
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">8. TERMS & CONDITIONS</div>
  <ol class="terms">
    <li contenteditable="true">This Work Order is valid for 30 days from the date of issue.</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Work will begin only after receipt of the agreed advance payment.</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">The advance payment is non-refundable once setup or configuration has started.</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Standard software features are included; additional features and customisation will be charged separately.</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Software source code, system architecture and server access remain the property of TechSeba unless agreed otherwise in writing.</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">The hosted service must be renewed annually to remain active.</li>
    <li contenteditable="true">Any dispute will be resolved through mutual discussion and, if required, under the jurisdiction of the courts of Bangladesh.</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="signatures">
    <div class="sig-box">
      <div class="sig-title">FOR TECHSEBA</div>
      Name: <div class="sig-line" contenteditable="true"></div>
      Designation: <div class="sig-line" contenteditable="true"></div>
      Signature & Seal: <div class="sig-line"></div>
      Date: <div class="sig-line" contenteditable="true"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sig-box">
      <div class="sig-title">FOR RAJON INTERNATIONAL</div>
      Name: <div class="sig-line" contenteditable="true"></div>
      Designation: <div class="sig-line" contenteditable="true"></div>
      Signature & Seal: <div class="sig-line"></div>
      Date: <div class="sig-line" contenteditable="true"></div>
